OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry at first. Outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, heavy at times, spread east
OL,7,Fduring the morning. The wind will
OL,8,Fstrengthen from the morning, reaching
OL,9,Fgale to severe gale later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFrequent heavy showers
OL,12,Fforming longer spells of rain at times
OL,13,Fthrough the evening and overnight.
OL,14,FStorm Boelo will bring very strong
OL,15,Fwinds with gales or severe gales.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FStorm Boelo will bring severe
OL,18,Fgales and heavy showers, rain turning
OL,19,Frather persistent at times. Winds
OL,20,Fgradually easing with drier interludes
OL,21,Fdeveloping later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
